<title>TURKMENISTAN: TABLE-Turkmen Jan-May trade surplus down sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Turkmen Jan-May trade surplus down sharply.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan posted a trade</p>
<p>surplus of $19 million in the first five months of this year</p>
<p>after a $373.9 million surplus in the same period of 1996, the</p>
<p>State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>TURKMEN MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-May 97  Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Exports (million dollars)   464.2	  842.5</p>
<p>    Imports			   445.2	  468.6</p>
<p>    Trade balance		   +19.0	 +373.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
